memories.template_body:
---
**{name}** | {title}
{department} | {company}
Tel: {phone}

\documentclass{article}
\title{项目周报}
\begin{document}
\maketitle
\section{本周进展}
\section{下周计划}
\end{document}

{type}({scope}): {简短描述}

{详细说明}

Refs: #{issue_id}

server {
    listen 443 ssl http2;
    server_name {domain};
    ssl_certificate /etc/ssl/{domain}.pem;
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://{backend};
    }
    location /static/ {
        root /var/www;
        expires 30d;
    }
}

Host dev
    HostName {dev_ip}
    User {user}
    IdentityFile ~/.ssh/id_ed25519
Host prod
    HostName {prod_ip}
    User {user}
    ProxyJump bastion
    StrictHostKeyChecking yes

尊敬的 {客户名}：
感谢您的反馈。关于您提到的 {问题}，我们的建议如下：
{解决方案}
如有疑问请随时联系我们。
祝好
{署名}

